CTP.excerpt:
) Weak cold front today, then a stronger system moves across PA on Thursday night and Friday
) Windy and wet end to the week with first flakes in the higher terrain
) Cold weather may end the growing season for many places Sat and Sun mornings.

RLX.excerpt:
) Round one of showers and thunderstorms occurs later this afternoon into early Thursday morning as a cold front drops into the region. An isolated severe thunderstorm is possible and repetitive showers/storms may cause some localized flash flooding.
) Round two of showers with gusty winds accompany a cold frontal passage on Friday.
) Much cooler temperatures with a threat of a frost/freeze over the weekend.
